-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §15 ערך שעה: the salary base an hour's value
-- is computed on, for a teaching employee under the reform — for a
-- substitution hour, the rules in force on the eve of the signing; for a
-- substitution hour done in a teaching-support hour's place, and for an
-- hour of absence deducted, the combined salary with the percentage
-- supplements the clause lists — and the hour value: the base over 4.33
-- weeks of 40 hours, or, off the reform from תשע"ב, of 24.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `15 ערך שעה`

-- akn:art_15__para_a The opening: the salary base of the hour value, for the purposes (1) and (2) list, for a teaching employee under the reform.

§§ `15(א)(1)`

-- (1): for a substitution hour (save one done in a teaching-support hour's
-- place, §9), the base is as the rules in force on the eve of the signing
-- had it. Those rules are not this agreement's: the base is an input.
@ref akn:art_15__para_a__subpara_1
`why a substitution hour's base is an input` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים בדבר תגמול עבור שעת מילוי מקום שחלו ערב חתימת ההסכם (13.8.2011)"

§§ `15(א)(2)`

-- (2): for a substitution hour done in a teaching-support hour's place,
-- and for the deduction for an hour of absence, the base is the combined
-- salary, the 1994 supplement, the 1987 framework supplement, the 2001,
-- 2008 and 2011 supplements, the 2011 erosion supplement, the Oz LaTmura
-- supplement and every other monthly percentage supplement in the salary.
@ref akn:art_15__para_a__subpara_2
@desc The monthly salary components §15(א)(2) builds the base of the hour value from, at the teaching employee's own values.
DECLARE `Oz hour-value base components` HAS
    `combined salary`                   IS A NUMBER @desc השכר המשולב
    `the 1994 supplement`               IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 94'
    `the 1987 framework supplement`     IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת מסגרת 87'
    `the 2001 supplement`               IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 2001
    `the 2008 supplement`               IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 2008
    `the 2011 supplement`               IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 2011
    `the 2011 erosion supplement`       IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת שחיקה 2011
    `the Oz LaTmura supplement`         IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת עוז לתמורה
    `every other monthly percentage supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc all the other monthly percentage supplements the employee is entitled to in his salary, together

GIVEN c IS A `Oz hour-value base components`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the Oz hour value` c IS
      c's `combined salary`
    + c's `the 1994 supplement`
    + c's `the 1987 framework supplement`
    + c's `the 2001 supplement`
    + c's `the 2008 supplement`
    + c's `the 2011 supplement`
    + c's `the 2011 erosion supplement`
    + c's `the Oz LaTmura supplement`
    + c's `every other monthly percentage supplement`

§§ `15(ב)`

-- (ב) ¶1–¶3: the hour value is the base of a full position over 4.33 weeks
-- times 40 hours. The clause rounds nothing: neither does the rule.
@ref akn:art_15__para_b akn:art_15__para_b/p2 akn:art_15__para_b/p3
`weeks in a month, for the hour value` MEANS 4.33

GIVEN `the base of a full position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz hour value` `the base of a full position` IS
    `the base of a full position` DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month, for the hour value` TIMES 40)

-- (ב) ¶4–¶6: from תשע"ב, for a teaching employee not under the reform, the
-- hour value is his own base of a full position (off the reform; the
-- clause does not list its components) over 4.33 weeks times 24 hours.
@ref akn:art_15__para_b/p4 akn:art_15__para_b/p5 akn:art_15__para_b/p6
GIVEN `the base of a full position off the reform` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour value off the Oz reform from 5772` `the base of a full position off the reform` IS
    `the base of a full position off the reform` DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month, for the hour value` TIMES 24)

§§ `15 -- illustrations`

`a base of 10,000 and 392 in supplements` MEANS
    `Oz hour-value base components` WITH
        `combined salary`                   IS 10000
        `the 1994 supplement`               IS 50
        `the 1987 framework supplement`     IS 40
        `the 2001 supplement`               IS 30
        `the 2008 supplement`               IS 20
        `the 2011 supplement`               IS 10
        `the 2011 erosion supplement`       IS 5
        `the Oz LaTmura supplement`         IS 200
        `every other monthly percentage supplement` IS 37

#ASSERT `the base of the Oz hour value` `a base of 10,000 and 392 in supplements` EQUALS 10392
#ASSERT `the Oz hour value` 17320 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the hour value off the Oz reform from 5772` 10392 EQUALS 100
-- the same base buys an hour 40/24 as dear off the reform as under it
#ASSERT `the hour value off the Oz reform from 5772` 17320 EQUALS `the Oz hour value` 17320 TIMES 40 DIVIDED BY 24
